{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53976","headline":"偈 十 · 景岑","name":"偈 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碍处无（《景德传灯录》作「非」）墙壁，通处勿（《景德传灯录》作「没」）虚空。\n若能（《景德传灯录》作「人」）如是解，心色本来同。\n（《祖堂集》卷十七、《景德传灯录》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}